                      {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
                      {
                        "cmd": "text",
                        "text": "Pokémon TCG is a game played with special cards placed on a 3x3 board."
                      },
                      {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
                      {
                        "cmd": "text",
                        "text": "Each card has 4 numbers on it, one per side.\\n These numbers are so-called stats."
                      },
                      {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
                      {
                        "cmd": "text",
                        "text": "Players take turns placing cards on the board. As they do so, they try to capture and gain control of their opponent's cards."
                      },
                      {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
                      {
                        "cmd": "text",
                        "text": "That's where the numbers come in. If a player places a card with a higher number next to a card with a lower number, the player captures that card."
                      },
                      {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
                      {
                        "cmd": "text",
                        "text": "Thus, the goal of the game is to gain control of more cards than the other player by the end of the game."
                      },
                      {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
                      {
                        "cmd": "text",
                        "text": "Notice that each space on the board is assigned a random type.\\nIf a card is placed on a space with the same type, it gains +1 to all its values."
